WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
How many are missing from a ten frame with 8?

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.110
Look at the empty boxes.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:06.300
Two.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.740
So 8 and 2 make 10.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:14.016
That is a number bond, and it makes adding much faster.
